# Right-click a line of a commit diff: Blame line puts the commit in the footer, and Show history for
# line opens the line history in the details pane. The diff is one added file, so it has one hunk.
fixture history
wait text "add md sample"
click 60 17
wait text "COMMIT FILES"
click 118 18
wait text "step_000"
click 60 9 right
snapshot menu
click 70 11
snapshot blame
click 60 9 right
click 70 12
snapshot line-history
